        "smithy.api#title": "1Password Users API",
        "smithy.api#documentation": "The 1Password Users API lets you list users, retrieve a single user, and\nsuspend or reactivate users in a 1Password Enterprise Password Manager\n(1Password Business tier) account. Use it to connect your 1Password account\nto a security automation platform so that events flagged by your security\ntools can trigger access remediation actions in 1Password.\n\nRequests are authorized with an OAuth 2.0 access token obtained through the\nclient credentials flow. The conventions for endpoint paths, pagination,\nfiltering, and errors apply across the whole API.\n\nThe error response format (`code` and `message`) is provisional and may\nchange in a future release."
